# Browser caching (13 Nov 2026, "Make the site load faster").
# Pictures are kept on the phone for a day, and for a week more they show at once while a fresh copy is fetched quietly.
# Pages, styles, scripts and the .json data files are NOT listed here, so they stay fresh on every visit and a "post" shows at once.
# If a picture is replaced under the same file name, add or raise ?v= where it is used (as the logo does), or phones may show the old one for a day.
/img/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800
